"display_name": "DreaMR: A. Scriabin\u2019s Mystic Symbolism", "keywords": ["DreaMR", "Scriabin", "Mystic", "Symbolism"], "long_description": "The MR offers a visualisation of A. Scriabin\u2019s Five Preludes Op. 74, piano miniature late works, considered to be sketches for his final multisensory drama Mysterium. A. Scriabin (1872- 1915) believed that his newly designed harmonic system in unity with other attributes of performing arts, such as dance, colour organ, perfume etc., through extasy of sensory stimulation brings human consciousness to a new horizons of the creative spirit. Scriabin\u2019s archetypes of musical texture: 1. Notion of Mystical Unity 2. The Divine Summons 3. The Eternal Feminine 4. Motive of light 5. Motive of flight 6. Vertiginous dances (by Susanna Garcia). His harmonies are based on a broader concept of temperament and he was precursor of Schoenberg\u2019s 12-note serialism and Messiaen's modes of limited transpositions. Scriabin operated by homeland Dual-Modality mode of enharmonic sequencies as described by Yavorsky/Dernova.\n\nBy interacting with virtual symbolic objects the spectator recalls different music tracks. Scriabin was a synesthete. In his time, he asked to design a simple lamp device to accommodate the illumination- \u201cto make the harmony more evident\u201d (Gawboy and Townsend). In the 21st century, we have MR environments to fulfil his vision and provide an environment for cognitive musicology. \nPiano performance and music analysis by Dr Svetlana Rudenko.\n\u201cExploring Dreaming with Mixed Reality\u201d (DreaMR) engages with the human experience of dreaming through art, music and consciousness science.\n", "short_description": "The MR scene offers a visualisation of A. Scriabin\u2019s Five Preludes Op. 74, one of piano miniature late works, which are considered to be sketches for his final multisensory drama Mysterium. \n\nBy interacting with virtual objects the spectator recalls different Preludes according to their symbolic meaning. DreaMR concept is \u201cExploring Dreaming with Mixed Reality\u201d. \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hauntedplanet.com/privacy/a-scriabins-mystic-symbolism", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Haunted Planet Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hauntedplanet.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25328503290119905"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824303_814065674735087_8014072156022768694_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iPOsz3Ma-KMQ7kNvwFYldrz&_nc_oc=AdoIoznbclBeWNxym659QbqDMi5FxvkBPClCKyY4TMD5p2PCUA3B-oZrDk0bDzhP4Y0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIoqQUXW325vpv0YY9-VGh3gZp8wRb8L5vNlMxOwd8Kvg&oe=6AA2C0A6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "DreaMR: A. Scriabin\u2019s Mystic Symbolism", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Media", "id": "434961926215971"}], "release_date": 1784230140, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "24957984053838499", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application